A: <p>For the alternatives, the solutions I see here either hardcode padding values, assume text is smaller than the scrollwidth, don't support inner-html structure, require extra outer-html structure, or use javascript.</p>
<pre><code>[marquee] {
  width     : max-content;
  position  : relative;
  animation : marquee 7s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes marquee {
    0% { left : 100%; transform : translateX(   0%); }
  100% { left :   0%; transform : translateX(-100%); }
}
</code></pre>
